{"type": "message", "id": "0b924d0f", "parentId": "99b0e8fd", "timestamp": "2026-04-09T15:39:18.018Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "f307df298d0346dc8bd768564a4d2155", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"Top Ten Challenged Books of 2020 American Library Association\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 915,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6ddc0289b26e2355\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nALA's Top Ten Most Challenged Books of 2020 - Intellectual Freedom Blog\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6ddc0289b26e2355\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.oif.ala.org/alas-top-ten-most-challenged-books-of-2020/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b8371e779d7dbb2c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nReynolds shares a story of police brutality toward a young Black teen and the white teen boy who witnesses the injustice. <strong>All American Boys</strong> highlights the reality of how racial inequities is often a life or death battle for the Black community.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b8371e779d7dbb2c\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"April 5, 2021\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.oif.ala.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"14e80b4b824d4b0a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nALA Unveils Top 10 Most Challenged Books of 2020 | Banned Books Week\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"14e80b4b824d4b0a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://bannedbooksweek.org/ala-unveils-top-10-most-challenged-books-of-2020/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb24878120b120f9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIt’s National Library Week, which means it’s time for the American Li