ription\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8e72770b08aea189\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFort Bragg public library is funded by Mendocino County but is supported by a hard-working non-profit: Friends of the Fort Bragg Library with great ambition and vision. The Friends is hoping to build an annex to provide more services to locals and visitors. Paid and volunteer staff sponsor book sale every year during Labor Day weekend with lots of great book deals available to readers of all levels and interest.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8e72770b08aea189\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.tripadvisor.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "Frequently Challenged Classics fortbragglibrary", "provider": "brave", "count": 10, "tookMs": 992, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9ddab7ec3491fd61\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nFrequently Challenged Young Adult Books - Fort Bragg Library\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9ddab7ec3491fd61\">>>", "url": "https://fortbragglibrary.org/frequently-challenged-young-adult-books/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"bd77376321e5b142\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWe compile lists of challenged books in order to inform the public about censorship efforts that affect libraries and schools. ... (Books written for YA audiences, those featuring a YA main character, and classics that regularly appear on high school required reading lists.)\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"bd77376321e5b142\">>>", "published": "September 24, 2016", "siteName": "fortbragglibrary.org"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"bc05a6c5cd550466\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nFort Bragg | Mendocino County, CA\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"bc05a6c5cd550466\">>>", "url": "https://www.mendolibrary.org/visit/fort-bragg", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTE